  "priorExpiration": "2006-01-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Auc 302.01 Apprenticeships. For an affidavit of apprenticeship to be accepted by the board under Auc 301.01(h)(1), an apprenticeship shall be served under one or more auctioneers for a period of not less than 6 months, with participation in all phases of auctioneering, as described in Auc 301.01(j) over the course of not less than 10 auctions under said auctioneers.\n\nSource. #1993, eff 3-31-82; ss by #2706, eff 5-10-84; ss by #4093, eff 7-21-86; EXPIRED 7-21-92\n\nNew. #5441, eff 7-27-92; ss by #6658, eff 1-1-98, EXPIRED: 1-1-06\n\nNew. #12201-B, eff 6-7-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/auc100-500.html"
